# Run r1103 slice A, boot 4: FRESH group B world (normal, structures on, seed 8675309), level sAb, current jars WITHOUT
# mods/endersdelight-1.19-1.2.2.jar (removed from srv/mods only; SQ-ENM-03 and -05b need that boot; sA_setup.md "Boot 4").
# Rows: SQ-ENM-05b, SQ-ENM-03, SQ-VTDA-10, SQ-GLD-14, SQ-GLD-09, SQ-CWG-07, SQ-CWG-06, SQ-CDM2-02, SQ-NEST-02.
# Home: marker sbhome at the console position (world spawn), capture SBH. Block rows build at y 200 above spawn (open
# sky in any terrain, inside the spawn chunks). Locates last (Async Locator; a rare one cannot be cancelled: gotchas.md).
# No /reload. If the boot does not reach Done without Ender's 1.2.2: SQ-ENM-03 FAILs (missing dependency); put the jar
# back, use a new level name, and run this file with --from SQ-VTDA-10.
pace 2

## SA4-00 | setup: home marker, clock, weather, forceload spawn (not a queue row)
bootexpect Done \(
> execute unless entity @e[type=minecraft:marker,tag=sbhome] run summon minecraft:marker ~ ~ ~ {Tags:["sbhome"]}
sleep 2
> data get entity @e[type=minecraft:marker,tag=sbhome,limit=1] Pos
capture SBH entity data: \[(-?\d+)\.\d+d, (-?\d+)\.\d+d, (-?\d+)\.\d+d\]
> gamerule doDaylightCycle false
> time set noon
> gamerule doWeatherCycle false
> weather clear 1000000
> gamerule doPatrolSpawning false
> gamerule doTraderSpawning false
> forceload add {SBH1-16} {SBH3-16} {SBH1+48} {SBH3+48}
sleep 30
> say SA4 setup done
expect SA4 setup done
shell ! ls mods | grep -q "^endersdelight-"
reject (Unknown (item|block|block type|entity)|does not (have|accept)|Incorrect argument for command|Unknown or incomplete command|That position is not loaded|No player was found|no such bot|no such item|Invalid (block state|tag)|\[(zq|sa|zp)\] (error|no player))

