sleep 2
> clear saend
> give saend endersdelight:voidpepper 4
> give saend endersdelight:amberveil_stew 1
> zp inv saend
> fill {SBH1} 199 {SBH3} {SBH1+12} 199 {SBH3+4} minecraft:glass
> fill {SBH1} 200 {SBH3} {SBH1+8} 200 {SBH3} minecraft:end_stone
