sleep 40
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 3
> execute if block {SBH1} 201 {SBH3} endersdelight:amberveil_mushroom run say SA4 p1 ok
> execute if block {SBH1+2} 201 {SBH3} endersdelight:ethereal_saffron_bush run say SA4 p2 ok
> execute if block {SBH1+4} 201 {SBH3} endersdelight:chorus_flame_block run say SA4 p3 ok
> execute if block {SBH1+8} 201 {SBH3} endersdelight:voidpepper_block run say SA4 p4 ok
> zq ages {SBH1+4} 201 {SBH3} {SBH1+6} 201 {SBH3} endersdelight:chorus_flame_block
> data get block {SBH1+8} 201 {SBH3}
